# Liquid water: 343 SPC/E molecules at 1.0 g/cm3 and 300 K.
# Rigid three-site water (SHAKE) with long-range electrostatics (PPPM).
# water.data is pre-equilibrated; make-water.in regenerates it.
#/atom 1 oxygen
#/atom 2 hydrogen
#/bond 1 2 1.25

units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p

read_data water.data

pair_style lj/cut/coul/long 9.0
pair_coeff 1 1 0.1553 3.166
pair_coeff 2 2 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff 1 2 0.0 1.0
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 450.0 1.0
angle_style harmonic
angle_coeff 1 55.0 109.47
kspace_style pppm 1.0e-4
special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.0
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

fix rigid all shake 1.0e-4 100 0 b 1 a 1
velocity all create 300.0 86151 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix nvt all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0
timestep 2.0

thermo 1000
thermo_style one

run 2000
